 "title": "Pullback of finite sheaves",
 "statement": "Let $g\\colon Y\\to X$ be a morphism and let $\\mathcal F\\in\\shv{\\et X}$ be\nfinite. Then $g^*\\mathcal F$ is finite.",
 "source": {
