   "text": "For a geometric point $\\bar y$ of $Y$, the stalk $(g^*\\mathcal F)_{\\bar y}$\nis the stalk $\\mathcal F_{g\\circ\\bar y}$ by\n[lemma-openclosed-stalk-upperstar], which is finite by hypothesis.",
